# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it) for tonight's four-card window.
# E1: today's PRODUCTION S2 (image tp4-serve-2, traffic profile c2-packed-tp4 as baked in that image: verify audits on, no tail
# caps) on CODING text, never measured before: the S2 baseline for tonight's T1 (caps) and T2 (audits off) comparisons, beside
# E3's G1 numbers. The smoke harness and its coding-text concurrency tests run from this job's checkout. The checkout's profile
# file is tp4/serve-3's (caps on), so a check that expects cap lines may flag this run; the container serves the image's own.
# Duration (estimate): 20-25 min.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-serve-2
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,coding,concurrent4,concurrent4_code,concurrent4_code_equal,concurrent4_steady
